{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is &quot;Gunzohg&quot;?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>2D side-scrolling action shooter</strong> where you take control of a heavily armored mech and blast your way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complicated story. No confusing equipment systems.<br>Just <strong>dash, jump, and blow up enemies</strong> as you charge to the right!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High-Speed Score Attack!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take down enemies quickly to trigger <strong>combo chains</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn massive <strong>score bonuses</strong> for stylish destruction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch piles of cash rain down on screen as your score skyrockets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aim for 1,000,000,000 points!</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Stress. Just Retry and Go!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroyed? No problem. You just restart the current stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your score is reset, but there are <strong>no penalties</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retry as many times as you like\u2014it's a <strong>player-friendly design</strong>.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880470?t=1756220425","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880470?t=1756220425","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880470/c7fcc8438af71816651f4db3add8fbfd2664bb45/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756220425","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880470/c7fcc8438af71816651f4db3add8fbfd2664bb45/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756220425","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"conten